[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2271405115","pull_request_review_id":3113035696,"id":2271405115,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc6HYuQ7","diff_hunk":"@@ -159,7 +159,11 @@ internal class FilesystemDirectoryAccess(private val context: Context, private v\n \t\t}\n \n \t\tval storageVolume = storageManager.storageVolumes[drive]\n-\t\treturn storageVolume.getDescription(context)\n+\t\treturn if (Build.VERSION.SDK_INT >= Build.VERSION_CODES.R) {\n+\t\t\tstorageVolume.directory?.absolutePath ?: \"\"\n+\t\t} else {\n+\t\t\t\"\"","path":"platform/android/java/lib/src/org/godotengine/godot/io/directory/FilesystemDirectoryAccess.kt","commit_id":"5bcf9a5a57e566f1ef244111cbd748b350299ac0","original_commit_id":"5bcf9a5a57e566f1ef244111cbd748b350299ac0","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I tested without SD card (only internal storage).\r\nI also have a Chromebook where I could try to test an external USB hard drive\r\n\r\n\r\n```suggestion\r\n\t\t\tstorageVolume.getDescription(context)\r\n```\r\n\r\n---------------\r\n\r\nNode: `FileDialog`\r\n`access` = `File System`\r\n\r\n---------------\r\n\r\nEmpty String looks strange in FileDialog.\r\n_(I think on Android 7 to 10 devices we can continue to display the name as it was before.)_\r\n\r\n\r\n<details><summary>Video: empty String</summary>\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/38884628-0bf5-4361-a33f-576f29b11f62\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n`storageVolume.directory?.absolutePath ?: \"\"`\r\n\r\nWhen exactly can `directory` be `null` here? The dropdown list would also look strange.\r\n\r\n-------------\r\n\r\n`storageVolume.getDescription(context)`\r\nMost Android users are more familiar with the localized name.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"672\" height=\"140\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2de46ca9-6711-444e-a54c-ceb678c2f0c2\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n-------------\r\n\r\nThis PR: `storageVolume.directory?.absolutePath`\r\n\r\nIt also looks odd having it appear twice, in the input field and the selection list. \r\nIsn't there another better solution to resolve the selection issues? \r\n\r\nThe correct approach would be to evaluate the volume index number (new API `get_drive_path`), but more changes would probably be needed in the core and the GD API. I think `DirAccess.get_drive_name` should continue to return the name as it did before.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"664\" height=\"118\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6f447448-9ad6-4254-aeec-307e3b9e7fc5\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","created_at":"2025-08-12T22:10:18Z","updated_at":"2025-08-12T22:47:13Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109528#discussion_r2271405115","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109528","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2271405115"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109528#discussion_r2271405115"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109528"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2271405115/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":165,"original_line":165,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":8,"position":8,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2271822109","pull_request_review_id":3113604705,"id":2271822109,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc6HaUEd","diff_hunk":"@@ -159,7 +159,11 @@ internal class FilesystemDirectoryAccess(private val context: Context, private v\n \t\t}\n \n \t\tval storageVolume = storageManager.storageVolumes[drive]\n-\t\treturn storageVolume.getDescription(context)\n+\t\treturn if (Build.VERSION.SDK_INT >= Build.VERSION_CODES.R) {\n+\t\t\tstorageVolume.directory?.absolutePath ?: \"\"\n+\t\t} else {\n+\t\t\t\"\"","path":"platform/android/java/lib/src/org/godotengine/godot/io/directory/FilesystemDirectoryAccess.kt","commit_id":"5bcf9a5a57e566f1ef244111cbd748b350299ac0","original_commit_id":"5bcf9a5a57e566f1ef244111cbd748b350299ac0","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"