"id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"> It also looks odd having it appear twice, in the input field and the selection list.\r\nIsn't there another better solution to resolve the selection issues?\r\n> \r\n> The correct approach would be to evaluate the volume index number (new API get_drive_path), but more changes would probably be needed in the core and the GD API. I think DirAccess.get_drive_name should continue to return the name as it did before.\r\n\r\nYeah, it looks a bit odd to directly show the path for drive but that's how it's done for other platforms too. We can create a new method for getting path, or we can modify the get_drive_name() to return a array instead of string, eg. [drive_name, drive_path].\r\nBut these changes warrent a discussion with other platforms first and won't be able to be merged for 4.5 now. I wanted to fix this in 4.5 itself so folks won't have to wait for another release for this fix and fortunately current fix is simple and safe.","created_at":"2025-08-13T01:09:55Z","updated_at":"2025-08-13T01:11:23Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109528#discussion_r2271848594","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109528","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2271848594"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109528#discussion_r2271848594"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109528"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2271848594/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":165,"original_line":165,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2271405115,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":8,"position":8,"subject_type":"line"}]